**Calendar:** Event creation, snapshot audience, RSVP, cancellation, class/whole-school visibility.

**Classes:** Class selection, roster, creation, assignment, Teacher Overview, administrative student opening and Back.

**Students:** Search, filters, paging, dossier, retry, privacy and navigation.

**Governance:** Account review, Manager delegation, privileged appointment, denied actions, audit and focus behavior.

**Parent Notes:** Quota boundary, sending window, verified child and Teacher scope, reply rules.

